{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ba0059137d05cad7","name":"Stereb","source":{"id":"source:reference-ba0059137d05cad7","title":"Stereb","revision":21753,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:25:19Z","sha256":"6dfb9645bdbe608ad649cdee0160bce7a5ce534b12380ce0dd7a7cdaf9218475","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21753","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Stereb&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ba0059137d05cad7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Sword of the Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sword_of_the_Empire","referenceId":"reference:56baf6e19ed21c48"},")"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Jokingly called \"hairless Wookiees\" by the few who have seen them, Stereb have been found on a number of worlds with rocky crusts. Not technologically adept, the Stereb live in harmony with the surfaces of a planet, working elaborate stone passages underground in the belief that they're part of the world's circulatory system.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Stereb Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Stereb are deliberate and methodical. Not being very curious, they tend to take things at face value. They are not aggressive and usually fight only if forced into a confrontation.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Stereb are tall humanoids with mostly hairless bodies that range from pale red to brown with reddish undertones. They have overly long arms and large hands and feet.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," The Stereb homeworld is unknown, although small enclaves have been found on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Serroco"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Serroco?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prakith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prakith","referenceId":"reference:a2d3eea7dbab0257"},", and a few other lightly populated planets. Given their lack of technology, some suspect that the Stereb were transported to several planets as slave labor far back in their history.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Stereb speak Stereb. They are able mimics, and there are a number of Basic words in the Stereb language.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Herdr'tui, Eldr'nol, Helr'ven. Stereb names include a Basic-sounding prefix relating to their function in the community (",{"tag":"i","children":["herdr"]}," means herder, ",{"tag":"i","children":["eldr"]}," means elder, ",{"tag":"i","children":["helr"]}," means healer, and so on).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Most Stereb prefer to remain within the safety of their enclaves. The few Stereb who wander abroad are most likely to be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"},". Stereb Force-users are very rare.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Stereb Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Stereb share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Stereb receive a +4 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," and a +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"},", but suffer -2 penalties to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},". Stereb are strong and hardy. They are not aggressive, and they might take time to reach a decision, but once they choose a course of action, they are deliberate and steadfast."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Stereb have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Stereb have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Conditional Bonus Feat:"]}," Stereb are very adept when working with stone. A Stereb who has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Mechanics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Mechanics)"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},". However, this bonus applies only when the Stereb character is working with stone."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Darkvision:"]}," Stereb ignore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," (including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Concealment"},") from darkness. However, they cannot perceive colors in total darkness."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Primitive:"]}," Stereb do not gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Heavy Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Heavy_Weapons)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Pistols)"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Rifles)"}," as starting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," at first level, even if their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class"}," normally grants them."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Subterranean:"]}," Stereb are adapted to a subterranean life and can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," checks when in an underground environment, even when distracted or threatened."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Tough:"]}," Like the stone they work with, Stereb are physically hardened, gaining a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," and a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Stereb can speak, read, and write Stereb."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
